WEB SOURCE (THE specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/AddressInput.tsx — a geocoded address autocomplete that wraps the
  shared @/components/forms `Combobox`. Controlled by its parent:
    props  : value, onChange(value), onSelect(TripLocation), placeholder?, label?
    debounce: setTimeout(() => setDebouncedQuery(value), 400)            (400 ms keystroke→query)
    data   : useGeocodeSearch(debouncedQuery)  (api/hooks/useDriving.ts)
             GET /geocode/search?q=<enc>&limit=5 ; enabled: query.length >= 3 ; select: safeArray
             returns GeocodeResult[] { display_name, lat, lng }
    select : handleSelect(r) -> onChange(r.display_name); onSelect({ lat, lng, name: r.display_name })
    Combobox: label = label ?? t('addressInput.label','Address'); hideLabel = !label; icon = <MapPin/>;
             noChevron; noClearButton; value = null; inputValue = value; onInputChange = onChange;
             options = results ?? []; getOptionLabel = r.display_name;
             getOptionKey = `${lat}-${lng}-${display_name}`; loading = isLoading && debouncedQuery.length >= 3;
             maxVisibleOptions = 5; allowFreeText; renderOption = <MapPin/> + line-clamp-2 display_name.
  The ONE i18n key the source extracts: addressInput.label = "Address".

