PARITY MAPPING (web -> Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  forms Combobox          -> native token-built autocomplete (field + menu) assembled from the SAME design tokens
                             the forms module's TSSearchInput/TSFormField use (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius).
                             TSFormField was NOT used because its LocalizedStringKey label resolves from the MAIN
                             bundle, not this surface's per-surface "AddressInput" table — so the label is rendered
                             with the same Font.TS.label role fed through the P1/S10 facade (i18n stays correct).
  lucide <MapPin/>         -> SF Symbol "mappin.and.ellipse" (field) / "mappin.circle.fill" (row, accent)
  debounce 400 ms          -> AddressInputConfig.debounceInterval (0.4 s); model coalesces keystrokes via a single
                             cancellable Task (debounce=0 path is synchronous for deterministic tests)
  query.length >= 3        -> AddressInputConfig.minimumQueryLength; below it the menu is the idle "keep typing" state
  &limit=5                 -> AddressInputConfig.resultLimit (projector caps rows at 5)
  getOptionKey             -> AddressSuggestion.id = "\(lat)-\(lng)-\(displayName)"  (identity + dedup key)
  getOptionLabel           -> AddressSuggestion.title = display_name ; renderOption line-clamp-2 -> .lineLimit(2)
  onSelect payload         -> TripLocationDTO(lat, lng, name: display_name)  forwarded to the injected onSelect
  onChange / inputValue    -> AddressInputModel.setQuery forwards raw text to the injected onChange (controlled input)
  hideLabel = !label       -> AddressInput(showsLabel:) ; the field keeps its VoiceOver label either way
  loading spinner          -> ProgressView in the field + a "Searching addresses…" row
  i18n                     -> every string via AddressInputStrings (table "AddressInput"); the web key
                             addressInput.label = "Address" is reproduced; the native state envelope adds prompt,
                             idle/empty/error chrome, freshness chip, banners, and a11y summaries — no English
                             literals live in the Swift sources.
  a11y                     -> field accessibilityLabel; per-suggestion role+address VoiceOver label; per-phase
                             results summary (idle/loading/N suggestions/empty/error); Dynamic Type via Font.TS;
                             decorative glyphs .accessibilityHidden(true).
  telemetry                -> view.opened surface="AddressInput" via the P1/S11 seam, emitted once on appear.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  idle     -> AddressInputIdleHint   (query < 3 chars; web hook disabled) — "Type at least 3 characters…"
  loading  -> AddressInputLoadingRow (web Combobox spinner) + spinner inside the field
  content  -> AddressSuggestionsList (web options; MapPin + clamped display_name; tap = select)
  empty    -> AddressInputEmptyState (resolved, no rows; web empty menu) — ContentUnavailableView, never blank
  error    -> AddressInputErrorView  (web QueryError, Retry -> model.refresh())
  stale    -> freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  -> freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached rows, no refetch
  +select  -> post-select confirmation (web collapsed menu + filled input) until the query is edited again

